  "query_preview": "..\n(Saturday night through next Thursday)\nIssued at 1244 PM CDT Fri Oct 16 2026\n\nThe forecast Sunday and beyond remains fairly benign. Upper ridging \nwill remain overhead through most of the coming week and will help \nto highs by mid week to the mid 70s on the Caprock and low 80s off \nthe Caprock with morning lows back in the mid 50s. Another upper \ndisturbance will begin to approach the FA by the end of the forecast \nperiod and could bring additional rainfall, but models continue to \ndiffer from run to run given the forecast being nearly a week out. \nIn the event that rain chances increase, amounts will not be nearly \nwhat was observed over the past few days.",
